# Local development environment variables for Meadow (community feed)
# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in actual values
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit it

# No secrets required for basic local dev.
# Meadow uses service bindings (AUTH) which resolve via
# platformProxy in dev mode or wrangler dev multi-config.
#
# If running standalone without service bindings:
# GROVEAUTH_URL=http://localhost:5177
